practice with complaint of blurred vision and
pain in the right eye for the past 3 days. She is
otherwise healthy and has not had any major
medical or surgical history. On examination, her
visual acuity of the right and left eyes are 6/12
and 6/6, respectively. She cannot read the
numbers in Ishihara chart and confuses red and
green. Other significant finding on examination
is worsening of the right eye pain with eye
movements that are normal and symmetric in all
directions with no diplopia. Which one of the
following could be the most likely diagnosis?','{"A":"Intracranial hemorrhage.","B":"Orbital tumor.","C":"Optic neuritis.","D":"Temporal arteritis.","E":"Retinal detachment."}',NULL,NULL,'{"source_relative_path":"AMEDEX 2025.09更新包/AMEDEX 2025 NEUROLOGY (3).pdf","supporting_pages":[],"source_qid":null,"duplicate_group_id":"exact-cb68652ef374","duplicate_sources":[{"record_id":"390fd7fe944d9249d5a7","record_type":"text_mcq","source_file":"AMEDEX 2025 NEUROLOGY (3).pdf","source_relative_path":"AMEDEX 2025.09更新包/AMEDEX 2025 NEUROLOGY (3).pdf","source_page":117,"source_qid":null},{"record_id":"5d09c8d77c3e301ba22c","record_type":"text_mcq","source_file":"AMEDEX 2025 NEUROLOGY (3).pdf","source_relative_path":"AMEDEX 2025.09更新包/AMEDEX 2025 NEUROLOGY (3).pdf","source_page":118,"source_qid":null},{"record_id":"68734ae24d93ca02f170","record_type":"text_mcq","source_file":"Amedex 2023.pdf","source_relative_path":"AMEDEX2025+redbook+handbook图片题/Amedex 2023.pdf","source_page":791,"source_qid":null}],"parser_version":"2.7.1-parser-only-conservative-staging-2026-09-22","parser_mode":"five_block_inferred","text_method":"tesseract_retry_200dpi_psm3","visual_asset":null,"asset_preview_url":null}',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'needs_verification','[]','low','{"record_id":"390fd7fe944d9249d5a7","source_file":"AMEDEX 2025 NEUROLOGY (3).pdf","source_relative_path":"AMEDEX 2025.09更新包/AMEDEX 2025 NEUROLOGY (3).pdf","source_year":2025,"source_page":117,"source_qid":null,"domain_hint":"Neurology","stem":"A 30-year-old woman presents to your general\npractice with complaint of blurred vision and\npain in the right eye for the past 3 days. She is\notherwise healthy and has not had any major\nmedical or surgical history. On examination, her\nvisual acuity of the right and left eyes are 6/12\nand 6/6, respectively. She cannot read the\nnumbers in Ishihara chart and confuses red and\ngreen. Other significant finding on examination\nis worsening of the right eye pain with eye\nmovements that are normal and