Emergency Department with confusion. He
is a known case of hypertension and heart
failure and is on indapamide and enalapril for
treatment. Laboratory studies are significant
fora 120 mmol/L serum sodium level. Which
of the following would be the most
appropriate next step in management?','{"A":"Restrict oral water intake to 500\nml/day.","B":"Hypertonic saline.","C":"Ee Stop indapamide.","D":"Stop enalapril.","E":"Stop both enalapril and\nindapamide."}',NULL,NULL,'{"source_relative_path":"AMEDEX 2025.09更新包/AMEDEX 2025 Nutrition _ Metabolism 1-9.pdf","supporting_pages":[],"source_qid":null,"duplicate_group_id":"exact-5e460cd30528","duplicate_sources":[{"record_id":"48102e71c7e7a5bf54d3","record_type":"text_mcq","source_file":"AMEDEX 2025 Nutrition _ Metabolism 1-9.pdf","source_relative_path":"AMEDEX 2025.09更新包/AMEDEX 2025 Nutrition _ Metabolism 1-9.pdf","source_page":25,"source_qid":null}],"parser_version":"2.7.1-parser-only-conservative-staging-2026-09-22","parser_mode":"five_block_inferred","text_method":"tesseract_retry_200dpi_psm3","visual_asset":null,"asset_preview_url":null}',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'needs_verification','[]','high','{"record_id":"48102e71c7e7a5bf54d3","source_file":"AMEDEX 2025 Nutrition _ Metabolism 1-9.pdf","source_relative_path":"AMEDEX 2025.09更新包/AMEDEX 2025 Nutrition _ Metabolism 1-9.pdf","source_year":2025,"source_page":25,"source_qid":null,"domain_hint":"Nutrition/Metabolism","stem":"A 64-year-old man is brought to the\nEmergency Department with confusion. He\nis a known case of hypertension and heart\nfailure and is on indapamide and enalapril for\ntreatment. Laboratory studies are significant\nfora 120 mmol/L serum sodium level. Which\nof the following would be the most\nappropriate next step in management?","options":{"A":"Restrict oral water intake to 500\nml/day.","B":"Hypertonic saline.","C":"Ee Stop indapamide.","D":"Stop enalapril.","E":"Stop both enalapril and\nindapamide."},"source_answer":null,"source_explanation":null,"source_answer_status":"pending_import","current_answer":null,"current_answer_status":"needs_verification","current_evidence":[],"currentness_risk":"high","currentness_keywords":["age","hypertension","management","treatment"],"likely_visual_question":false,"pars